/-! The all-failure MAC test plan generated by a capped organizer attacker.
Canonical signing is an opaque service, and non-byte-aligned direct hash queries
are answered by the independent part of the split random oracle. -/

namespace SigGolfCandidate.SphincsTypedInteractionPlan
